[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8641.85, "timestamp": "02:24:01", "text": "确实有所改进"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8642.99, "timestamp": "02:24:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8647.469, "timestamp": "02:24:07", "text": "很多。是的。已经过去一段时间了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8651.67, "timestamp": "02:24:11", "text": "现在。好的。等等，你……你和……一起做的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8654.71, "timestamp": "02:24:14", "text": "是手机手指画的那种，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8657.27, "timestamp": "02:24:17", "text": "是的。虽然我有一台平板电脑，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8660.63, "timestamp": "02:24:20", "text": "我仍然用手机和手指画画。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8664.19, "timestamp": "02:24:24", "text": "那很好。那挺好的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8666.429, "timestamp": "02:24:26", "text": "好兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8673.59, "timestamp": "02:24:33", "text": "不错，兄弟。我开始制作模型。是的，我看了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8676.79, "timestamp": "02:24:36", "text": "转发PNG，不过是的，它仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8679.99, "timestamp": "02:24:39", "text": "这不是模型，它就像一个单独的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8681.95, "timestamp": "02:24:41", "text": "PNG"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8685.51, "timestamp": "02:24:45", "text": "嗯，等等，我刚才说的是，如果可以的话，我想问问。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8688.23, "timestamp": "02:24:48", "text": "是什么促使你想要重新打造这个品牌？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8689.91, "timestamp": "02:24:49", "text": "发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8692.469, "timestamp": "02:24:52", "text": "我的意思是，呃，我只是想重新打造品牌形象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8694.87, "timestamp": "02:24:54", "text": "因为呃，基本上现在的名字是DH了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8696.95, "timestamp": "02:24:56", "text": "那是我身边的一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8699.11, "timestamp": "02:24:59", "text": "上学时间甚至在发现之前"}]